<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT ESTONIA 7-1 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT ESTONIA 7-1 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTETTEN, Austria 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria beat Estonia 7-1 (halftime 3-0) in an under-21 European soccer championship group 4 qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Austria - Weissenberger 3, Aufhauser 10, 17 and 75,</p>
<p>Brunmayer 49, 62 and 65</p>
<p>Estonia - Allas 89</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
</text>
